The '''Artifact Trove''' is an [[Artifacts|artifact]] container that can be traded from the [[Desert Trader]] for 5 [[Omni Geode]]s each. The [[Bookseller]] may trade 3 Artifact Troves for 1 [[Treasure Appraisal Guide]], provided the player has already obtained the power from that book. Up to 5 can be purchased from [[George]]'s [[Desert Festival#Villager Shops|shop]] at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|10|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]]s each. 

It can also be obtained by [[Pans|panning]], dropped by [[Haunted Skull]]s if all [[Bundles#Vault|Vault Bundles]] have been completed, found in [[Supply Crate]]s on the [[Farm Maps#Beach|Beach Farm]] once the player has upgraded the [[Farmhouse]] at least two times, or dug up from [[Artifact Spot]]s on [[Ginger Island]]. Four or five Artifact Troves can be obtained as a prize from the [[Mayor's Manor#Prize Machine|Prize Machine]]. Five Artifact Troves may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern. It can also be gifted by a [[Animals#Pets|pet]] dog with max [[Animals#Friendship|friendship]].

Although most of the contents are artifacts, there are a few items, namely the [[Golden Pumpkin]], [[Pearl]], [[Treasure Appraisal Guide]], and [[Treasure Chest]],  which are not.

The Artifact Trove can be broken open at the [[Blacksmith]] for {{Price|25}} to obtain the contents inside. It cannot be broken open using a [[Geode Crusher]].

