==Bundles==
Artifact Trove is not used in any [[bundles]].

==Tailoring==
Artifact Trove is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the [[File:Shirt290.png|24px|link=]] [[Tailoring#Shirts|Trinket Shirt]]. 

==Quests==
Artifact Trove is not used in any [[quests]]. 

==Notes==
* By multiplying the sell price of each item by the chance to obtain it, the average profit of opening an Artifact Trove without having read the [[Treasure Appraisal Guide]] is {{Price|472.4}}, or {{Price|447.4}} when the {{Price|25}} opening cost is factored in. The profit after having read the guide is {{Price|660.4}}, or {{Price|635.4}} when the {{Price|25}} opening cost is factored in.
* Since the average profit when breaking open an Omni Geode is {{Price|96.4}}, and it takes five Omni Geodes to trade for one Artifact Trove (''i.e.,'' {{Price|482.0}}) at the [[Desert Trader]], you will typically lose {{Price|35}} every time you trade for one (if you have not yet read the [[Treasure Appraisal Guide]]). After having read it however, you will typically earn {{Price|153}} per trade. This assumes you sell the contents.

